+issueNumber: MDL-88319
+notes:
+  core:
+    - message: >-
+        A new hook `\core\hook\output\before_help_icon_rendered` is dispatched
+        in `core_renderer::render_help_icon()` before the help icon template is
+        rendered. Callbacks may modify the mutable template context
+        (`$hook->context`), add HTML before or after the icon with
+        `add_before_icon()` / `add_after_icon()`, or replace the icon output
+        entirely with `set_replacement()`.
+      type: improved
